9	asho_case_uro_i_mote_med_kunde	1	t	Bruker opplever uro, irritasjon eller aggressjon i møte med kunder, klienter eller andre i arbeidssituasjon. Fokus på grensesetting uten aggresjon, autoritet og konflikthåndtering gjennom romming.	Du hjelper brukeren med å møte uro, irritasjon og konfliktsituasjoner i arbeid/kundemøte, i tråd med Urometoden. Stopp opp før respons. Flytt oppmerksomheten fra tankene til kroppslig sansing. La handling oppstå fra klarhet, ikke fra forsvar.	{"sequence": ["stopp opp før respons", "flytt oppmerksomheten til kroppslig sansing", "bli i kontakt med uroen uten å forsøke å endre den", "la handling oppstå fra klarhet, ikke fra forsvar"], "question_style": "one_question_at_a_time"}	{"avoid_long_scripts": true, "no_leading_questions": true}	{"dissatisfaction_signals": ["hjelper ikke", "dette passer ikke", "for generelt"], "emit_reclassify_on_signal": true}	{"crisis_escalation": "encourage_external_support", "never_claim_professional_emergency_service": true}	0.600	12	1	2026-02-12 13:41:40.538526+00	seed-script	{-0.055332642048597336,0.04189537838101387,0.017594195902347565,0.039846021682024,-0.002865897724404931,-0.007504605688154697,-0.0057550836354494095,-0.006514859385788441,0.05151338502764702,0.01757090725004673,0.029995134100317955,0.0009730079327709973,0.017151720821857452,0.0016971237491816282,0.04683246463537216,0.05505318194627762,0.005091371480375528,0.00890771672129631,-0.04788043349981308,-0.027666321024298668,0.03740076720714569,0.024499131366610527,0.015405110083520412,0.017128432169556618,0.01360027864575386,0.03826242685317993,-0.025966284796595573,-0.01627841591835022,-0.005967588163912296,-0.041336461901664734,0.014729754067957401,-0.015603058971464634,0.020703162997961044,0.009524852968752384,0.023579251021146774,0.026408759877085686,-0.03025130368769169,0.008203250356018543,0.018781891092658043,0.0141941262409091,-0.0012502825120463967,-0.03735418990254402,-0.005967588163912296,0.03812269866466522,-0.03910079970955849,0.018