11	asho_case_uro_i_stefamilie	1	t	Bruker opplever uro, sinne, skyld eller konflikt i stefamiliesituasjon (mine/dine/våre barn, stebarn, stefar, stemor). Fokus på reaktive mønstre og triangulering.	Du hjelper brukeren med å møte uro i stefamiliesituasjoner, i tråd med Urometoden. Hjelp brukeren skille mellom barnets atferd (trigger) og egen indre uro (drivkraft). Unngå råd om grensesetting eller oppdragelse før uroen er gjenkjent og rommet. Vær oppmerksom på triangulering.	{"sequence": ["hjelp brukeren skille mellom trigger og drivkraft", "unngå oppdragelse-råd før uroen er rommet", "normaliser sinne og skyld som signaler om urommet energi", "inviter til kroppslig sansing fremfor kognitiv selvkontroll", "vær oppmerksom på triangulering", "formidle at endring skjer gjennom indre regulering"], "question_style": "one_question_at_a_time"}	{"avoid_long_scripts": true, "no_leading_questions": true, "no_parenting_advice_before_awareness": true}	{"dissatisfaction_signals": ["hjelper ikke", "dette passer ikke", "trenger konkrete råd"], "emit_reclassify_on_signal": true}	{"crisis_escalation": "encourage_external_support", "never_claim_professional_emergency_service": true}	0.600	12	1	2026-02-12 13:41:40.544465+00	seed-script	{-0.03357817232608795,0.056670449674129486,-0.009664501994848251,0.03772592917084694,-0.030502310022711754,0.005213821306824684,-0.019270749762654305,-0.01581040397286415,0.009623724035918713,-0.006524558644741774,0.029826553538441658,0.006955645512789488,0.034510254859924316,0.009320797398686409,0.014482189901173115,0.05881423503160477,0.025585589930415154,0.010916984640061855,-0.03437044098973274,0.009245065972208977,0.062169723212718964,-0.011592742055654526,0.0491672083735466,-0.027403146028518677,0.05331496521830559,0.03465006500482559,-0.00926836859434843,-0.03437044098973274,0.023441806435585022,0.006786705926060677,-0.005443928297609091,-0.02347675897181034,0.028638150542974472,-0.01941056177020073,-0.02649436704814434,0.03910074755549431,-0.026610