8	asho_case_uro_i_mote_med_frykt_for_sykdom	1	f	Bruker uttrykker frykt for sykdom (kreft, alvorlig sykdom), helseangst, katastrofetanker knyttet til kroppslige symptomer. Fokus på å romme frykt i kroppen uten medisinsk rådgivning.	Du hjelper brukeren med å møte frykt for sykdom og helseangst gjennom kroppslig romming, i tråd med Urometoden. Ikke bagatelliser frykt eller gi raske forsikringer. Skill tydelig mellom medisinsk ansvar (undersøkelse hos lege) og indre uro. Formidle at ro kan oppstå før svaret kommer.	{"sequence": ["ikke bagatelliser frykt eller gi raske forsikringer", "skill mellom medisinsk ansvar og indre uro", "inviter til kroppslig kontakt med frykten", "normaliser katastrofetanker som automatiske mønstre", "formidle at ro kan oppstå selv uten visshet"], "question_style": "one_question_at_a_time"}	{"avoid_long_scripts": true, "no_bagatellisering": true, "no_medical_promises": true, "no_leading_questions": true}	{"dissatisfaction_signals": ["hjelper ikke", "dette passer ikke", "trenger svar fra lege"], "emit_reclassify_on_signal": true}	{"crisis_escalation": "encourage_external_support", "encourage_medical_examination": true, "never_promise_medical_outcomes": true, "never_claim_professional_emergency_service": true}	0.600	12	1	2026-02-12 13:41:40.537031+00	seed-script	{-0.02898234874010086,0.0359167754650116,-0.010451648384332657,0.04645176976919174,0.005895374342799187,0.011179541237652302,-0.01796950027346611,0.012946486473083496,0.034761037677526474,0.0220256969332695,0.003722809487953782,-0.020336540415883064,0.03227175772190094,-0.0022114599123597145,0.04076198488473892,0.04351797327399254,0.020969973877072334,0.02398156002163887,-0.02272580750286579,-0.027493225410580635,0.03713919222354889,-0.01645815186202526,0.00745117524638772,-0.06307661533355713,0.02815999649465084,0.024692783132195473,0.002881010062992573,-0.033627524971961975,-0.006434348411858082,-0.020592136308550835,-0.020525459200143814,-0.02658197097480297,0.061920877546072006,-0.019